     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Passing Every Durability Test: With a main body made of a lightweight metal alloy specialized for measuring machines and equipped with high-quality brand-name components, »smile« devices are extremely robust and durable. Whether in large-scale production or a medium-sized operation—thanks to the various sizes, electronics, and configuration options, »smile« is ideal for day-to-day use in any manufacturing environment, even right next to the CNC machine.</p>",
