  {
   "type": "hotspots",
   "header": "",
   "intro": "",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_smileCompact_hotspots_414afaf178.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1238,
    "h": 709
   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 42.935,
     "y": 34.82,
     "label": "one-hand control handle",
     "text": "<h3>one-hand control handle</h3> <h4>one-hand control handle</h4> <p>For quick and safe adjustment of the measuring slide on both axes at the push of a button.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 51.685,
     "y": 45.066,
     "label": "Image Processing | Optics",
     "text": "<h3>Image Processing | Optics</h3> <h4>Image Processing | Optics</h4> <p>Reliable precision guaranteed—with a telecentric lens and CCD camera, including integrated 360° LED incident light for cutting-edge inspection.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 51.141,
     "y": 60.057,
     "label": "SK50 High-Precision Spindle",
     "text": "<h3>SK50 High-Precision Spindle</h3> <h4>SK50 High-Precision Spindle</h4> <p>Impressive features include integrated calibration balls and a runout accuracy of 0.002 mm. Separate zero gauges are unnecessary.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 76.522,
     "y": 35.958,
     "label": "user interface",
     "text": "<h3>user interface</h3> <h4>user interface</h4> <p>ZOLLER measuring machine control (panel PC) with a 13-inch touchscreen.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 79.783,
     "y": 58.065,
     "label": "table electronics",
     "text": "<h3>table electronics</h3> <h4>table electronics</h4> <p>Table electronics with variable monitor position and space for a label printer and key tray.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 66.467,
     "y": 75.712,
     "label": "label printer",
     "text": "<h3>label printer</h3> <h4>label printer</h4> <p>The label printer outputs necessary tool parameters, such as ID and adapter numbers, Z and X coordinates, radius measurements, and angles, in plain text or as codes.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 49.62,
     "y": 69.165,
     "label": "membrane keypad",
     "text": "<h3>membrane keypad</h3> <h4>membrane keypad</h4> <p>The membrane keypad controls all power-operated functions of the spindle, such as the spindle brake, 4 x 90° locking caps, and the optional vacuum clamp.</p>"
    }
   ],
