  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/4/csm_smileBasic_c5c667fc07.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "From »pilotBasic« <br>to »»smileBasic««",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>From »pilotBasic« <br/>to »»smileBasic««</h3> <p>The »pilotBasic« electronics system with a 7-inch monitor transforms »smile« devices into a »smileBasic«. You’ll benefit from a quick learning curve and fast measurement, adjustment, and inspection of tools. The focus lies on the basic requirements of professional tool presetting: fast measurement results at the push of a button and cutting-edge inspection with 12x magnification.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/0/csm_smleCompact_pilotStarter_0f40c1e19a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "From »»pilotStarter«« to »»smileCompact««",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>From »»pilotStarter«« to »»smileCompact««</h3> <p>A »smileCompact« presetting unit comes with the base unit plus the »»pilotStarter«« measuring software. This software stands out for its simple operation and practical functions: Measurement macros with tool images for quick and simple measurement, automatic detection of the cutting-edge shape and measurement range, determination and measurement of the maximum contour, and the »»compass«« navigation system<br/> for exact, user-independent positioning of the target dimension.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/5/csm_smileAdvance_6e07496a15.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "With »pilot 2 mT« to »»smileAdvance««",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>With »pilot 2 mT« to »»smileAdvance««</h3> <p>With a ZOLLER »smileAdvance« presetting and measuring machine and the »»pilot 2 mT«« measuring software, you simply get more: more measuring functions, more screen space thanks to the 17-inch color monitor, more flexibility thanks to freely resizable areas such as the cutting edge pattern, and more features: Management of your machines, setup sheets, and graphics, as well as tool data transmission to your machine in controller format.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
